  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Kinetic energy of translation $=\\frac{3}{2} n R T$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& n=\\frac{50 \\mathrm{~g}}{44 \\mathrm{~g}}=\\frac{25}{22} \\mathrm{~mol} \\\\\n& T=17^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}=290 \\mathrm{~K}\n\\end{aligned}$\n$\\Rightarrow$ Kinetic energy of translation\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& =\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\frac{25}{22}\\right)(8.3)(290) \\mathrm{J} \\\\\n& =4102.8 \\mathrm{~J}\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
